      "content": "TL 0902            ABBOTS LANGLEY        HIGH STREET                                          (Southeast side)                                          Abbots Langley 11/36                                    No. 5 GV                                       II House. C18, possibly earlier origins, altered C20. Whitewashed brick. Tiled roof. 2 storeys. 2 window front. Central entrance with bracketed hood.  3 light timber casements, flush frames, ground floor cambered head. Projecting course at eaves. Left end stack. Extruded stack to rear. Included for group value. Listing NGR: TL0954702200"
